commits.message:
security: add NoHostnameGrants score, plugin-score-network, GUI score checks update

- plugin-score-network: new dedicated plugin emitting NoHostnameGrants ScoreCheck;
  fails when any non-locked account uses a DNS hostname as Host (unsafe under both
  skip_name_resolve=ON where it silently breaks login, and =OFF where DNS spoofing
  is possible); localhost, %, and IP addresses are exempt
- cluster.go: add NoHostnameGrants to SecurityScore struct, ApplyCheck, and Compute
- SecurityScoreModal: add noWeakAuthPlugin and noHostnameGrants to CHECK_LABELS;
  reorder checks by category (auth group together, network group together);
  remove stale hardcoded count comments

